Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.11,0:00:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Kikkun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.26,0:00:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnFredoka\b1\fs22\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.5\pos(101.333,253.867)}I love quizzes, datsun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.87,0:00:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(187.733,286.578)}It's quiz time! 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.86,0:00:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.48,0:00:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.39,0:00:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I picked up an awesome urban legend!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.43,0:00:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Just telling it normally wouldn't be fun, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.43,0:00:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, even so, \Nyou don't have to turn it into a quiz.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.59,0:00:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it's boring, \Njust tell me normally.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.71,0:00:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then-
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.76,0:00:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.40,0:00:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That "well then" is the "well then" from \N"Now for question number one," right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.63,0:00:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You just sneak quizzes in whenever you get the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.43,0:00:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we drinking next, mames?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.87,0:00:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How about being a little adventurous and \Nmixing things together, mames?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.23,0:00:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how about we both say our choice \Non three and mix them, mames?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.27,0:00:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds good, mames!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.43,0:00:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready, go! \NOolong tea!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.78,0:00:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.42,0:00:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I went ahead and ordered just the drink bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.10,0:00:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a problem at all! 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.62,0:00:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ta-da! 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.26,0:00:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.73,0:00:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.24,0:00:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a quiz, right? No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.03,0:00:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so dead set against quizzes?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.80,0:00:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Lately, whenever you turn on the TV at home, \Nit's nothing but quizzes, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.28,0:00:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That is so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.64,0:00:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You really want to escape from quizzes \Nwhen you're in your private time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.03,0:00:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's coming from someone \Nwho makes a living off quizzes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.19,0:01:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Mogura, \Nwhat was that awesome urban legend you mentioned earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.24,0:01:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? \NWhat is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.97,0:01:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Please let us hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.23,0:01:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you see, Mogura turns the whole \Nthing into a quiz and won't actually tell us at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.99,0:01:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not very nice, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.28,0:01:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does Mole always make everything a quiz?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.00,0:01:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Quiz?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.68,0:01:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.70,0:01:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I use a Phone-a-Friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.69,0:01:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(205.6,229.333)}{\fnFredoka\b1\fs20\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.5\\10c&H6D4325&\4a&H05&}Why do they always turn everything into a quiz?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.99,0:01:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Is that a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.48,0:01:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.90,0:01:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.20,0:01:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, right,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.99,0:01:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to do facial recognition.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.96,0:01:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's not it—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.46,0:01:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just wondering how you're supposed to use a Phone-a-Friend.
